---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Bail Services | Rajendra Criminal Law Firm" description="Informational overview of bail applications in Chennai.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Blog</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Bail Services</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Bail is a procedural right that allows an accused person to remain free pending trial, subject to conditions. This article is for general information only.</p>
      <p>Applications may be filed before the Magistrate, Sessions Court, or the Madras High Court depending on the stage and nature of the offence.</p>
      <p>Timely preparation of documents and grounds is important. For case-specific advice, consult an advocate.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-navy/10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-xl text-navy mb-4">Related</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/practice/bail" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Bail & Anticipatory Bail</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact" class="text-navy hover:text-crimson">Contact the Firm</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
